---
title: About
layout: base.njk
---
<h1>About {{ club.name }}</h1>

<section class="club-section">
  <div class="club-text">
    <h2>Our club</h2>
    <p>{{ club.history }}</p>
  </div>
  <img class="club-flag" src="/assets/images/liffey-flag.svg" alt="Liffey Toastmasters club flag, a maroon and gold feather-shaped banner">
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Our members</h2>
  <p>{{ club.area }}</p>
  <p>We currently have a membership of approximately {{ members.count }}.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Club committee</h2>
  <p>Our club is managed by a committee of volunteers. This year some roles
  are shared between two co-officers (a "double committee"). Below are the
  Club Officers for this year:</p>
  <ul class="committee-list">
    {% for officer in committee %}
    <li><strong>{{ officer.role }}</strong> &ndash; {{ officer.name | join(' & ') }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
